  const Player2 = remainingPlayers[randomIndex];

  // You can now proceed with your logic using Player1 and Player2
  console.log("Player1:", Player1);
  console.log("Player2:", Player2);
}
```

**Explanation:**

- `reduce` is used to find the player with the lowest `Matches`.
- `filter` creates an array of all players except `Player1`.
